@startuml
title Secuencia: Sincronización de datos (ESP32 → Servidor)

actor ESP32
participant "BluetoothProvider (App)" as App
participant "SQLite Local DB" as LocalDB
participant "DataSync (syncWithCloud)" as Sync
participant "SensorService" as APIClient
participant "API Server" as Backend

ESP32 -> App: Notify (JSON: temp,hum,volt,relay)
App -> App: handleIncomingData(json)
App -> LocalDB: INSERT lecturas (temp,volt,hum,fecha)
note right: saveToLocal() guarda en SQLite

... periódicamente ...

Sync -> LocalDB: SELECT * FROM lecturas ORDER BY id ASC
LocalDB --> Sync: [rows]
loop por cada row
  Sync -> APIClient: saveSensorData(row)
  APIClient -> Backend: POST /api/sensores {temp,volt,hum,fecha}
  Backend --> APIClient: 200 OK
  APIClient --> Sync: success
  Sync -> LocalDB: DELETE FROM lecturas WHERE id = ?
end

Sync --> App: devuelve cantidad subidos

@enduml
